# VoiceNText 插件级 .gitignore
# 只忽略本插件的生成物；Source/、Content/、Config/、Resources/、Build/ 与 .uplugin 均应入库。

# ---- 编译与中间产物 ----
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/

# ---- IDE / 本地工程文件 ----
.vs/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userprefs

# ---- 调试与临时文件 ----
*.pdb
*.tmp
*.log
